&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Secure Every Identity, from AI to Human&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Identity is the key to unlocking the potential of AI. Okta secures AI by building the trusted, neutral infrastructure that enables organizations to safely embrace this new era. This work requires a relentless drive to solve complex challenges with real-world stakes. We are looking for builders and owners who operate with speed and urgency and execute with excellence.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is an opportunity to do career-defining work. We&#39;re all in on this mission. If you are too, let&#39;s talk.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-sourcepos=&quot;11:1-11:364&quot;&gt;Our team is looking for a Sales Development Representative (SDR) to join our sales organization. This isn&#39;t just about hitting call numbers; it&#39;s about strategically identifying, engaging, and qualifying high-value target accounts to generate significant pipeline and fuel Okta&#39;s continued market leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-sourcepos=&quot;13:1-13:282&quot;&gt;If you have a hunger for exceeding targets and a desire to work on complex, enterprise-level opportunities, we want to talk to you. This role offers a direct pathway to further your career in a dynamic, fast-growing cybersecurity environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-sourcepos=&quot;15:1-15:33&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;What You&#39;ll Do (Your Impact):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-sourcepos=&quot;17:1-25:0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-sourcepos=&quot;17:1-17:247&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Spearhead Strategic Outbound Prospecting:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll own the identification and engagement of key decision-makers within target enterprise accounts, employing sophisticated, multi-channel outreach strategies (call, email, social selling, video).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-sourcepos=&quot;18:1-18:200&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generate High-Quality Pipeline:&lt;/strong&gt; Go beyond lead generation. You&#39;ll deeply qualify, nurture, and convert prospects into sales-ready meetings and opportunities for our elite Account Executive team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-sourcepos=&quot;19:1-19:196&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Become an Okta Evangelist:&lt;/strong&gt; Master Okta&#39;s value proposition and articulate how our solutions address critical business challenges and deliver tangible outcomes for diverse enterprise clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-sourcepos=&quot;20:1-20:199&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate for Success:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with Account Executives, Field Marketing, and Product Specialists to develop targeted campaigns, refine messaging, and ensure seamless deal progression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-sourcepos=&quot;21:1-21:203&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Driven Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Leverage our best-in-class SaaS toolkit (Salesforce, Outreach, etc.) to meticulously manage your pipeline, track engagement, and identify insights for continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-sourcepos=&quot;22:1-22:139&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exceed Expectations:&lt;/strong&gt; Consistently achieve and surpass monthly/quarterly quotas for qualified opportunities and pipeline contribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-sourcepos=&quot;23:1-23:147&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Represent Okta:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a brand ambassador at industry events (virtual and in-person), building your network and uncovering new opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-sourcepos=&quot;26:1-26:36&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;What You Bring (Your Expertise):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-sourcepos=&quot;28:1-36:0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-sourcepos=&quot;29:1-29:181&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Master of Outbound:&lt;/strong&gt; Expertise in crafting compelling messaging, cold calling, objection handling, and leveraging modern sales engagement platforms (e.g., Outreach, SalesLoft).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-sourcepos=&quot;30:1-30:166&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exceptional Communicator:&lt;/strong&gt; Articulate, persuasive, and engaging, with outstanding written and verbal communication skills tailored for senior-level interactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-sourcepos=&quot;31:1-31:166&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic &amp;amp; Results-Oriented:&lt;/strong&gt; A self-starter with a hunter mentality, driven by results and capable of developing and executing strategic prospecting plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-sourcepos=&quot;32:1-32:135&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consultative Approach:&lt;/strong&gt; Skilled in active listening, uncovering nuanced customer needs, and aligning them with relevant solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-sourcepos=&quot;33:1-33:142&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech Savvy:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficient with CRM (Salesforce preferred) and other sales productivity tools. Quick to learn and adapt to new technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-sourcepos=&quot;34:1-34:119&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Resilient &amp;amp; Adaptable:&lt;/strong&gt; Thrives in a fast-paced, dynamic team environment and can navigate change effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-sourcepos=&quot;35:1-36:0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organizational Prowess:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent time management and organizational skills, with the ability to manage multiple priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-sourcepos=&quot;37:1-37:13&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Why Okta?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-sourcepos=&quot;39:1-39:112&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact &amp;amp; Visibility:&lt;/strong&gt; Play a crucial role in Okta&#39;s growth engine, with direct contribution to revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-sourcepos=&quot;40:1-40:173&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Career Advancement:&lt;/strong&gt; Clear pathways for high-performing SDRs to progress into Account Executive roles, leadership, or other strategic positions within the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-sourcepos=&quot;41:1-41:142&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;World-Class Product &amp;amp; Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Represent an industry-leading identity solution and collaborate with talented, passionate professionals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-sourcepos=&quot;42:1-42:130&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Learning:&lt;/strong&gt; Access to ongoing training and development to hone your skills and deepen your cybersecurity knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-sourcepos=&quot;43:1-44:0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive Compensation &amp;amp; Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; We reward success and offer a comprehensive package, including amazing &lt;a href=&quot;https://rewards.okta.com/aus&quot;&gt;perks&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-sourcepos=&quot;45:1-45:129&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If you&#39;re ready to make a significant impact and accelerate your career with a market leader, apply today!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;#LI-Onsite&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;#LI-MT1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Okta Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://rewards.okta.com&quot;&gt;Supporting Your Well-Being&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.okta.com/company/okta-for-good/&quot;&gt;Driving Social Impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.okta.com/company/talent-connection-community/&quot;&gt;Developing Talent and Fostering Connection + Community&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are intentional about connection. Our global community, spanning over 20 offices worldwide, is united by a drive to innovate. Your journey begins with an immersive, in-person onboarding experience designed to accelerate your impact and connect you to our mission and team from day one.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Okta is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, ancestry, marital status, age, physical or mental disability, or status as a protected veteran. We also consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and convictions records, consistent with applicable laws.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If reasonable accommodation is needed to complete any part of the job application, interview process, or onboarding please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1EfiEYZrIyhA2X4Fijk0R3RKYOzNoS3wtvyM4nhbZnXE/edit&quot;&gt;use this Form&lt;/a&gt; to request an accommodation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Notice for New York City Applicants &amp;amp; Employees: Okta may use Automated Employment Decision Tools (AEDT), as defined by New York City Local Law 144, that use artificial intelligence, machine learning, or other automated processes to assist in our recruitment and hiring process. In accordance with NYC Local Law 144, if you are an applicant or employee residing in New York City, please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://talent.okta.com/new-york-city-aedt-notice.html&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; to view our full NYC AEDT Notice.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
